; The hibiscus's tree form (2026-09-29, her "give the hibiscus tree the bark
; too", then "build both versions"): the hibiscus's egg of leaf clumps and
; flowers on the azalea tree's crown size and barked trunk, about 2.75 m tall.
; The shape is `assets/source/props/hibiscus_tree.blend`; Send to game writes
; the GLB. `bloom`, `size` and `season` work as on the hibiscus shrub. Visual
; only.

